  "body": "Refs #67. 在现有 Python SSR Operator Console 中实现逐 Claim 处置提议与 TEST_ONLY 验证预览，复用已验收 ReviewCommandProposal / CoverageAcknowledgementProposal / validate_proposal。原任务池→报告→ReviewTarget→原始来源链路保留。没有第二套 UI 或审核规则引擎。\n\n## 最终提交与基线\n\n**最终 HEAD：`fc948b5a7d3caa106cecf29e1049fa0222b59671`**\n\n- 最新已验收 main：`558d183624a0a36d1f4eaf9d3d75af73b9c88547`（Owner FINAL PASS 合并 PR #69）；最终 fetch 确认未再推进。\n- 普通 merge：`0f4acc2cb9922d857b51abc247b2541ed42a8b37`，顺序父为旧候选 `5c9d018d5fc76b4df265c1d518d836c463e7c7bf`、上述 main。无 rebase/强推。\n- 六项实际 checkout 均为 `b1e0a0a70631957f06e88d85df3f3d09a8541cf3`；顺序父为 **558d main、fc948 HEAD**。\n- HEAD tree = CI merge tree = `9ad188ba0999a187d9634edcf353d46e05e2cfc8`。\n- 4,554 个受保护文件的 Git blob/mode 不变，原58+43 Console测试文件不变。P2A 全部源码/SQL/CI/QA 保留，未接线 UI；只在 Owner 合并后复用其只读 artifact auditor。\n- app 功能源码冻结 `c5789e01b206d683be115d026b87a0f939db5503`，最终测试源码 `47964b714a458d9b4e8d31ade4b5b4b35e6ab6f1`。本地最新main回归实际 HEAD 为上述 0f4；最终 app/test 字节与封存一致。\n\n## 实际交互与安全边界\n\n404 六项 Claim 可逐项查看原始引用、UTF-8 范围、机器状态与类型限定处置，必须主动选择并确认四类 section。支持 APPROVE_CANDIDATE、定位退回修改、定位拒绝；后两者必须有原因和对应 Claim。所有动作只构造原生提议并验证，不改变报告或任务状态。\n\n200 三项字面来源 / 零问题仅构造独立 CoverageAcknowledgementProposal，显示 SIMULATED_INTERNAL_SCOPE_ACK；native H0 / ReportVersion 保持 null，明确“在已检查的范围内未发现可确认问题”。无候选批准或补造问题。403/robots/UNKNOWN 不开放表单。\n\n每个预览请求重新校验 scope/assignment/tenant/owner、独立 task→case、target/version/draft、完整原生来源/Guard；提交精确 Claim 三元身份及 target-bound section。假设仍 HUMAN_REVIEW_REQUIRED，网站文字仅证明字面来源。缺失/重复/外来Claim、语义升级、来源/版本篡改及伪造actor均拒绝。\n\n仅显式双旗标的 loopback fixture harness 接受 bounded proposal-preview POST，精确 Host/Origin（含拒绝 null Origin）、禁止 Cookie/Authorization/TE/重复头、24576-byte/64-field/UTF-8/类型/未知字段边界。普通 ConsoleInterface POST / ConsoleService.mutate / 真实 prepare 仍 always-deny。无真实认证/session/审批/持久化/ShareGrant/客户访问/导出/模型/部署。\n\n## 六项最终真实 CI：全部 SUCCESS\n\n| Job | 实际结果 |\n|---|---|\n| [contracts-domain 3.11](https://github.com/gloweaseco-leo/VRAE/actions/runs/43341331812/job/131617171918) | 2410 passed / 25 existing skipped |\n| [contracts-domain 3.13](https://github.com/gloweaseco-leo/VRAE/actions/runs/43341331812/job/131617169120) | 2410 passed / 25 existing skipped |\n| [isolated-http](https://github.com/gloweaseco-leo/VRAE/actions/runs/43341331812/job/131617173113) | 2434 passed / 1 existing skipped |\n| [isolated-browser](https://github.com/gloweaseco-leo/VRAE/actions/runs/43341331812/job/131617224022) | SUCCESS / 245 条原始安全 summary |\n| [postgres-16 3.11](https://github.com/gloweaseco-leo/VRAE/actions/runs/43341331796/job/131610108352) | SUCCESS |\n| [postgres-16 3.13](https://github.com/gloweaseco-leo/VRAE/actions/runs/43341331796/job/131610107926) | SUCCESS |\n\n标准 run `43341331812`：首次 3.13 在固定12m14s取消，取消前无断言失败；同一 SHA 仅重跑失败项，attempt2 3.13用时8m52s成功，其余成功项由GitHub继承。没有改变代码、测试、超时或CI。首次原始日志与两次job元数据完整保留。skip按实披露，不算通过。\n\n三个非browser默认job均从原始日志核验冻结QA V2 **118 actual passed / oracle未改** 与原D1/D2 **127 collected/called/passed**。PG原样复用已验收main auditor，双运行时分别实际核验 **P1-v1 54、v2 compatibility54、原pure11、新pure14、P2A86**，独立原始字节/完整graph、RLS、迁移、dump/restore/restart、故障与正常清理、源码及artifact digest全部通过；兼容重放不是108个独立P1案例。\n\n原始日志 SHA256：\n```\ncontracts-domain 3.11 6e69a1db293c0400a5715229f1d817d67364b2d292053e4585881f626934e2d4\ncontracts-domain 3.13 82bcd95483eb1770fa2077cf854d87af1d0c204b750bcbd60b6e24cd2e8e6aa4\nisolated-http         237aa68125e9bfe3d548862185bdb86603931beb85e9d4c42f8241196c8e3f78\nisolated-browser      fa41b1a2365fcfc65da9550cb55d54d179cce42a235046541cc536254dd27150\npostgres-16 3.11      0db88a544b4bc42c567bb81880b6496162745c8823a8f42fd19310c361883e9c\npostgres-16 3.13      4f43f322427f889b84a95929466eb5e024d6e970dd2df29fa1371a12f8f3be2b\n```\n\n原始 GitHub artifacts：\n- [browser security ZIP](https://github.com/gloweaseco-leo/VRAE/actions/runs/43341331812/artifacts/13999526673)，SHA256 `6d0bf66fb37689137302db177c3b5ecbd48e8a6f24e4e3a6214f3b3df3790887`\n- [PG 3.11 ZIP](https://github.com/gloweaseco-leo/VRAE/actions/runs/43341331796/artifacts/13999731339)，SHA256 `219e3e35a4a689ad3d5c8af14a3f4dc9a69dc27a156e4627491c9cd1ca8fcfdb`\n- [PG 3.13 ZIP](https://github.com/gloweaseco-leo/VRAE/actions/runs/43341331796/artifacts/14000465744)，SHA256 `1d328f9b5afec3cd0739bb2442501b98480fc8ba3aad4ee78ae24934fc7958c3`\n\n## 本地实际测试与演示\n\n- 最新 main 上 Python3.11/3.13各 **324 passed**：原58 + C1原43 + 新96 + 原reviewing127，零失败/跳过；实际validator/replay/原生调用与前后源码哈希核验。每轮4条既有JUnit record_property元数据警告原样保留。\n- Chromium156，1280/375/320真实click/keyboard/中文原因/form POST **75/75**，**24张PNG**，DOM/CDP/network与截图哈希。来源back/forward、三个404动作、200/null、重开未提交、stale/语义升级/注入全部通过；≥12px提示、≥44px主控件、无横溢/外部页面请求。\n- [375px空提议](https://github.com/gloweaseco-leo/VRAE/blob/fc948b5a7d3caa106cecf29e1049fa0222b59671/docs/03-engineering/ra4c2-review-proposal/evidence/browser-2026-11-12T23-22-38-056Z/proposal-fresh-404-375.png) · [320px候选预览](https://github.com/gloweaseco-leo/VRAE/blob/fc948b5a7d3caa106cecf29e1049fa0222b59671/docs/03-engineering/ra4c2-review-proposal/evidence/browser-2026-11-12T23-22-38-056Z/candidate-preview-404-320.png) · [定位退回](https://github.com/gloweaseco-leo/VRAE/blob/fc948b5a7d3caa106cecf29e1049fa0222b59671/docs/03-engineering/ra4c2-review-proposal/evidence/browser-2026-11-12T23-22-38-056Z/request-changes-375.png) · [200范围ACK](https://github.com/gloweaseco-leo/VRAE/blob/fc948b5a7d3caa106cecf29e1049fa0222b59671/docs/03-engineering/ra4c2-review-proposal/evidence/browser-2026-11-12T23-22-38-056Z/coverage-ack-200-375.png)\n- [启动/消费合同](https://github.com/gloweaseco-leo/VRAE/blob/fc948b5a7d3caa106cecf29e1049fa0222b59671/docs/03-engineering/ra4c2-review-proposal/README.md) · [完整矩阵](https://github.com/gloweaseco-leo/VRAE/blob/fc948b5a7d3caa106cecf29e1049fa0222b59671/docs/03-engineering/ra4c2-review-proposal/TEST-MATRIX.md) · [三场景/截图索引](https://github.com/gloweaseco-leo/VRAE/blob/fc948b5a7d3caa106cecf29e1049fa0222b59671/docs/03-engineering/ra4c2-review-proposal/DELIVERY.md) · [来源blob/mode封存](https://github.com/gloweaseco-leo/VRAE/blob/fc948b5a7d3caa106cecf29e1049fa0222b59671/docs/03-engineering/ra4c2-review-proposal/SOURCE-SEAL.json)。\n\n## 完整原始回执\n\n按提交前已声明的防SHA漂移流程，post-CI文件保留授权目录，不追加Git提交：\n\n```\nD:/Projects/VRAE-Codex2/.worktrees/ra4c2/docs/03-engineering/ra4c2-review-proposal/evidence/\n  hosted-43341331812-20261113T012547/ACCEPTANCE.json\n  hosted-43341331812-20261113T012547/receipt.json\n  hosted-43341331812-20261113T012547/FINAL-ARTIFACTS.json\n  hosted-43341331812-20261113T012547/RA4C2-final-evidence.zip\n  hosted-43341331812-20261113T012547/BUNDLE.json\n  hosted-43341331796-20261113T010145/PG_P2A_ACTUAL_RECEIPT.json\n```\n\nZIP **227文件 / 16,130,734 bytes**，SHA256 **`bbb64a99bcf8ccd676fe1e1b14e2da4c1f235704f84e04a3551af0fe778eff21`**。包含所有历史失败/取消/旧源/旧main通过记录、最新双324、24截图/DOM/CDP、最终六CI原始Git/API/log/安全和PG ZIP、完整main PG核验、最终source/artifact审计。最终 audit.py 已实际通过，状态 **SIX_CI_GREEN_ENGINEERING_CANDIDATE_NOT_OWNER_FINAL_PASS**。\n\n保留初始缺失模块RED、Origin:null真实403（仅本地表单same-origin Referrer-Policy修复，null仍拒绝）、折叠区断言失败、worker TCP-loopback超时（隔离内AF_UNIX驱动同一HTTP Handler，32请求断言不变，新增真实内核拒绝；普通环境仍TCP）、CI运行时超时/同SHA重试。新测试只复用原生输入模板逐例深拷贝，所有被测native验证仍真实执行。旧5c9六绿因main已推进拒作最终验收。未改原始事实、Guard、QA、网络策略、测试预期或CI超时获得GREEN。\n\n## 未开放 / 停止边界\n\n仅 synthetic、TEST_ONLY、PRIVATE_NOT_APPROVED。真实身份/session+assignment、production immutable bytes/latest ledger、真实CAS/native/full decision/audit/outbox/recovery接线仍需单独Owner放行；本轮无真实批准/退回/拒绝、数据库接线、ShareGrant、客户访问、模型、外发或部署。Human Gold0/26、RA4 EXIT/RA5/E2/E3仍NO_GO。\n\n保持 **Draft**、无auto-merge，未自行合并或部署。工程交付完成，停止等待Owner独立exact-SHA验收。\n",
